param spectral spectral_partials_on unit=choice choice=Off|On
param spectral spectral_partials_mode unit=choice choice=Peaks|Harmonics|Centers
param spectral spectral_partials_count unit=number min=1 max=320 stepped=0
param spectral spectral_partials_set unit=number min=-8388608 max=8388608 stepped=0
param spectral spectral_partials_depth unit=percent min=0 max=1 stepped=0
param spectral spectral_curve_on unit=choice choice=Off|On
block spectral spectral_freeze floats=523
block spectral spectral_curve_db floats=64
retired spectral spectral_curve 2026-10-27 the drawn curve left the row's extra state (128-float cap) for the hand's block spectral_curve_db, which saves it whole
retired spectral spectral_comb_hz 2026-10-12 the comb is always in harmonics of f0 now (C3 raised by Key Offset with Key Track off), so f0 × Spacing covers a spacing in Hz
